Spec: Heading

Purpose:
  Heading-up bearing for the live map and the split that lets the route line end at the gliding position marker.

Owns:
  ./heading.dart
  /test/domain/heading_test.dart

References:
  /lib/map/map.sdd

Must:
  Bearings are degrees clockwise from north in `[0, 360)`.
  The heading is taken from recorded points only, re-measured every 10 m or more,
    and ignores turns below 10 degrees.
